---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Disclaimer";
const description = "Disclaimer of liability for calculations and documents generated on ToolsWaala.";
---

<Layout title={`${title} | ToolsWaala`} description={description} currentPath="/disclaimer">
  <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8;">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>Last updated: July 21, 2026</p>
    
    <h2>Calculations and Outputs</h2>
    <p>The calculators and estimators on ToolsWaala are intended for informational and educational purposes only. While we strive to maintain accurate mathematical formulas and data (such as tax slabs, interest rates, and HRA policies), we make no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or suitability of the outputs.</p>
    
    <h2>Legal Documents</h2>
    <p>The legal document templates (such as rent agreements, NDAs, and service agreements) generated on our platform are standard drafts. ToolsWaala is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice. Using these documents does not create an attorney-client relationship. You should consult a qualified legal professional to verify document compliance with state and local laws before executing them.</p>
    
    <h2>No Warranties</h2>
    <p>Any reliance you place on such information is strictly at your own risk. In no event will we be liable for any loss or damage including without limitation, indirect or consequential loss or damage, or any loss or damage whatsoever arising from loss of data or profits arising out of, or in connection with, the use of this website.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="seo-article" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2>Legal & Financial Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>The information, calculators, invoice generators, tax tools, and legal contract templates provided on ToolsWaala (https://www.toolswaala.in) are intended solely for general informational and educational purposes.</p>

    <h3>1. Not Professional Financial, Tax, or Legal Advice</h3>
    <p>ToolsWaala is not a certified chartered accounting firm, legal practice, or financial advisory institution. The results produced by our GST calculators, Income Tax regime comparisons, EMI calculators, and legal agreement generators should not be substituted for professional advice from a qualified Chartered Accountant (CA), certified financial planner, or licensed attorney.</p>

    <h3>2. Accuracy of University Grading Formulas & Academic Rules</h3>
    <p>CGPA to percentage conversion formulas displayed on ToolsWaala are sourced from official university ordinances (VTU, Mumbai University, AKTU, Anna University, SPPU, DU, KTU, CBSE). However, university regulations may be revised periodically by examination boards. Students are advised to verify final marks conversion against official university marksheets and registrar certificates before submitting transcripts for higher education or government jobs.</p>

    <h3>3. External Links & Third-Party Services</h3>
    <p>ToolsWaala may contain links to third-party websites or government examination portals (e.g. UGC, AICTE, NTA, SHCIL, GST Portal). ToolsWaala assumes no responsibility or liability for the content, privacy policies, or practices of external third-party sites.</p>
  
    <h3>ToolsWaala Quality Assurance & Feedback Guidelines</h3>
    <p>We take software accuracy, user data privacy, and web accessibility extremely seriously. ToolsWaala is built following W3C accessibility guidelines, ISO security practices, and modern Core Web Vitals performance benchmarks. Every calculator and generator is audited regularly against revised government tax notifications (CGST/SGST/IGST), Reserve Bank of India (RBI) payment directives, and University Grants Commission (UGC) academic mandates.</p>
    <p>If you encounter any calculation discrepancy, broken link, or rendering glitch on your mobile device or browser, please report it directly to our technical operations desk at <code>info@toolswaala.in</code>. Include your device type, operating system version, and screenshot if available to help our engineering team reproduce and deploy a instant hotfix within 24 hours.</p>

</article>

</Layout>
